		)
		(uuid "c41dc7dd-8af3-45dc-8cfc-34a19f096ca3")
	)
	(text "- Pull-up resistors on SPI lines\n- Impedance and length matching for SPI lines\n- UART and PWM series resistors value \n- 3.3V Buck converter and LDO design"
